# Keep the sbx image build contexts tiny.
#
# Both kit Dockerfiles build with $SBX_ROOT as the docker context:
#   bin/sbx build <stack>          → containers/Dockerfile (COPYs containers/entrypoint.sh)
#   vm/sbxvmd build                → vm/sbxvmd/Dockerfile  (COPYs vm/sbxvmd/entry)
#   daemon RecipeImageEnsure       → same as bin/sbx (dashboard create)
# Everything else — vm/images/ alone is ~1 GB once fetched — must not ride
# along in the context upload of every build.
*
!containers/
!containers/Dockerfile
!containers/entrypoint.sh
!vm/
!vm/sbxvmd/
!vm/sbxvmd/Dockerfile
!vm/sbxvmd/entry
